            "scope": "power.body",
            "text": "Commercial electricity demand is growing 3.5%, nearly twice the 1.8% increase in total retail demand, while retail prices are up 5.1%. Net planned generation additions through the pipeline horizon total 227.6 GW, but planned supply is not delivered capacity. Utility Dive reported that PJM was urged to delay its base-capacity auction until data centers were cut from the forecast. The request does not establish that PJM\u2019s forecast is overstated; it shows that data-center assumptions are consequential and disputed in capacity-market planning."
